    "id": "c115df05f71843b8",
    "title": "Meteora unveils DLMM Pro, a customizable AMM for Solana token launches",
    "summary": "DLMM Pro's customizable features could enhance Solana token launches, potentially increasing protocol adoption and benefiting MET holders.\nThe post Meteora unveils DLMM Pro, a customizable AMM for Solana token launches appeared first on Crypto Briefing.",
    "hasSummary": true,
